📌 Project Overview

This project analyzes the performance of an e-commerce business across Sales, Customers, Products, and Operations using Power BI.

The dashboard was designed to help business stakeholders monitor revenue performance, customer behavior, product profitability, and operational efficiency through interactive visualizations and KPI tracking.

The solution is divided into three analytical pages:

Executive Sales Overview
Product & Customer Analysis
Operations & Logistics
🎯 Business Objectives

The dashboard aims to answer key business questions:

How is the business performing financially?
What is driving revenue growth?
Which customer segments contribute most to revenue?
Which products and brands generate the highest sales?
How effective are discounts?
What operational issues impact performance?
How can customer retention be improved?
