Key Business Insights
Revenue Performance
Total Revenue reached ₦20.55M
Revenue exceeded the business target by over 150%
Revenue Growth achieved 47.9% YoY
Customer Acquisition
Total Customers increased by 40.5%
Total Orders increased by 51.5%
Customer Segmentation
New Customers generated the highest revenue (₦7.2M)
Returning Customers contributed ₦6.8M
VIP Customers generated ₦6.6M
Revenue Distribution
Revenue is relatively balanced across regions
Owerri emerged as the highest revenue-generating region
Customer Spending
Average Order Value declined by 2.4%
Customers are purchasing more frequently but spending slightly less per order
Recommendations

✅ Invest further in customer acquisition campaigns

✅ Develop loyalty programs to convert new customers into repeat buyers

✅ Introduce upselling and bundling strategies to increase AOV

✅ Promote alternative payment methods to reduce payment concentration risk

